# Feature: create

**Goal:** Template → Photos → Details → Preview → Share link (&lt;3 min, guest OK).

Full spec: `docs-site/content/create-blueprint.md`

## Files

```
domain/types.ts, templates.ts, quota.ts (todo)
application/useCreateDraft.ts, CreateDraftContext.tsx
data/creationRepository.ts, uploadService.ts (todo)
ui/screens/*.tsx
```

## Acceptance (ship checklist)

- [ ] 1–3 photos, name required
- [ ] Real `shareUrl` from API (not demo string)
- [ ] Share sheet / WhatsApp intent
- [ ] Free quota → paywall modal
- [ ] Vault nudge on ShareSuccess
- [ ] Unit tests for `canPreview` + quota rules

## API (see api-contracts.md)

- `POST /v1/uploads/presign` → upload bytes
- `POST /v1/creations` → `{ shareUrl, creationId }`

## Analytics events

`create_started`, `template_selected`, `photos_added`, `preview_opened`, `card_shared`, `upload_failed`
